Looking at the comment, I need to express that for every bit index, the bit is true after the AND if and only if it was true before AND the corresponding bit in `set` was true.

The observer method is `get(int bitIndex)`. The "if and only if" is a biconditional, which I can express with `==` on the boolean values.

<code>assert \forall int i; i>=0 && i<this.size(); this.get(i) == (\old(this.get(i)) && set.get(i));</code>
